# 1. Ignore everything by default
*

# 2. Let Git look inside every folder (keeps your structure)
!*/

# 3. Allow only these file types
# Python code
!*.py
!*.ipynb
# Datasets
!*.csv
!*.tsv
!*.xlsx
!*.xls
!*.json
!*.parquet
# Documents and text
!*.docx
!*.doc
!*.txt
!*.md
!.gitignore

